{"id":"siempre-en-mi-mente-tmdb-1714722","type":"MOVIE","category":"INDIE","title":"Siempre en mi Mente","overview":"Juan Gabriel ha sido el compositor e intérprete más grande de todo México. Un grupo de imitadores emprende un viaje a través de la memoria, el deseo y la transformación, preguntándose: ¿Somos más reales cuando nos convertimos en alguien más? ¿O acaso nuestro verdadero yo tiende a desaparecer?","releaseDate":"2026-09-10","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMc1ZcbuiXAJneYyuXTSz413O3S.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jeu2ifxefHS4n73XfVt1rvzip9W.jpg","genres":["Documental"],"originalLanguage":"es","spokenLanguages":["Spanish"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/jeu2ifxefHS4n73XfVt1rvzip9W.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4YTaePN8Y253ai1guRxDp1rKpY7.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/wSHvUyNppHUJO48dkOZRuocztrG.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/v7UFSAF1krzKSpYjYMOTkKPjPyL.jpg","label":"Escena 04"}],"ratings":{},"availability":{},"crew":[{"name":"Dan Escárraga","role":"Director of Photography","personTmdbId":5010582,"department":"Camera"},{"name":"David Limón","role":"Producer","personTmdbId":5995937,"department":"Production"},{"name":"Francisco Gómez Guevara","role":"Sound","personTmdbId":4100711,"department":"Sound"},{"name":"Carlos Edelmiro","role":"Musician","personTmdbId":3287393,"department":"Sound"},{"name":"Mariana A. Erdman","role":"Production Office Assistant","personTmdbId":4866695,"department":"Crew"},{"name":"Sebastián Díaz Barriga","role":"Director","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xEMwIWvB7qUnW6Knb62qJd0pkqH.jpg","personTmdbId":5010581,"department":"Directing"}],"overviewLanguage":"es-MX"}